  "description": {
   "en": "Aiden is a quarterback and Seowon is a chronically ill forest boy. Could it be any more obvious? Seowon can’t quite bring himself to believe that a popular football player has been crushing on him for years, but Seowon’s remote forest home might be the perfect place for romance to take root. But Aiden is only visiting Korea–is two weeks enough time to establish a relationship, or…a family?\n\n[**Original Novel**](https://ridibooks.com/books/3352000005)\n\n[**Original Webtoon**](https://ridibooks.com/books/1483029238)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n[English](https://tapas.io/series/gentle-forest-mature/info), [French](https://www.bontoon.com/detail/bt_1110770), [German](https://www.delitoon.de/detail/dbd_10048), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/177863)"
